%27%2F%27%29%7C%7Cpath.includes%28%27%5C%5C%27%29%7C%7Cpath.includes%28%27%5C0%27%29%7C%7Cpath.includes%28%27%3A%27%29%29return%20false%3B%0A%20for%28const%20part%20of%20path.split%28%27%2F%27%29%29if%28%21part%7C%7Cpart%3D%3D%3D%27.%27%7C%7Cpart%3D%3D%3D%27..%27%29return%20false%3B%0A%20return%20true%3B%0A%7D%0A%2F%2A%2A%20Three%20Number%20facts%20per%20module%3A%20literal%20token%2C%20attribute%20start%20and%20after.%0A%20%2A%20Only%20actual%20outer%20attributes%20attached%20to%20an%20actual%20planned%20module%20count.%0A%20%2A%20Function%20bodies%20and%20macro%20inputs%20cannot%20invent%20a%20path%20interpretation.%0A%20%2A%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20kinds%20%40param%20%7Bstring%5B%5D%7D%20values%20%40param%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20plan%0A%20%2A%20%40returns%20%7Bnumber%5B%5D%7D%20%2A%2F%0Aexport%20function%20readRustProjectModulePathAttributes%28kinds%2Cvalues%2Cplan%29%7B%0A%20let%20selected%3D%5B%5D%3B%0A%20let%20position%3D0%3B%0A%20while%28position%3Cvalues.length%29%7B%0A%20%20const%20kind%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Cposition%29%2Cvalue%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Cposition%29%3B%0A%20%20if%28kind%3D%3D%3D%27punct%27%26%26value%3D%3D%3D%27%23%27%26%26position%2B1%3Cvalues.length%29%7B%0A%20%20%20const%20inner%3DreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Cposition%2B1%29%3D%3D%3D%27%21%27%2Copen%3Dposition%2B%28inner%3F2%3A1%29%3B%0A%20%20%20if%28open%3E%3Dvalues.length%7C%7CreadRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Copen%29%21%3D%3D%27punct%27%7C%7CreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Copen%29%21%3D%3D%27%5B%27%29%7Bposition%2B%3D1%3Bcontinue%3B%7D%0A%20%20%20const%20after%3DgroupEnd%28kinds%2Cvalues%2Copen%29%3B%0A%20%20%20if%28open%2B1%3Cvalues.length%26%26readRequiredTextFact%28values%2Copen%2B1%29%3D%3D%3D%27path%27%29%7B%0A%20%20%20%20if%28inner%7C%7Cafter%21%3D%3Dopen%2B5%7C%7CreadRequiredTextFact%28values%2Copen%2B2%29%21%3D%3D%27%3D%27%7C%7CreadRequiredTextFact%28kinds%2Copen%2B3%29%21%3D%3D%27string%27%29throw%20new%20TypeError%28%27Rust%20project%20path%20attrib